# Runtime data: the single runtime root (NEXT_TUTOR_DATA_DIR, default
# .runtime/) plus the legacy per-directory roots must never be committed.
# The repository ships source, tests, deployment templates and synthetic
# fixtures only — no textbook sources, parsed text, chunks, knowledge
# graphs, vector indexes or per-user state.
# NOTE: these rules are deliberately anchored (/) — unanchored `knowledge/`
# or `notes/` would also ignore the source packages app/agents/knowledge/
# and the frontend pages/components of the same name.
.runtime/
/traces/
/uploads/
/tool-output/
/chroma_db/
/vector_db/
/chat_history/
/knowledge/
/notes/
/students/
/users/
/acceptance-reports/
/docs/show/
/deploy/pages-demo-extra/
/apps/web/public/demo/
/services/api/traces/
/services/api/uploads/
*.log

# Generated demo/website build output (produced by CI, never committed).
/apps/web/out/
/apps/web/dist/classroom/
/services/api/app/classroom/static/generated/

# Local planning documents stay out of version control.
plan.md
clean-plan.md
docs/The_Website_deployment_plan.md

